{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國製造業再次開始增加就業崗位。但問題在於：想要獲得這些工作，你可能需要擁有大學學位。這一轉變對美國經濟具有重大影響。高技能崗位通常薪酬更高，也能為僱主創造更多利潤，從而推動經濟增長。但由於這些崗位對教育水平的要求更高，如果人才培養項目跟不上產業發展步伐，企業就可能面臨熟練勞動力短缺的問題。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583898.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T07:00:21.947767+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:42:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T06:58:07.067800+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T06:58:07.067800+00:00","content_hash":"db6475c0a1e6f3b329ccdf00a2f3d7d2d22acff73e4eb568e42057d1fcaf6009","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}